     =========================== -->
<section class="slide motivation-slide grid-bg" id="slide-2">
  <div class="orb orb-blue" style="width:clamp(150px,25vw,350px);height:clamp(150px,25vw,350px);bottom:-5%;right:10%;opacity:0.3;"></div>
  <div class="accent-bar"></div>
  <div class="slide-num">02 / 09</div>
  <div class="slide-content">
    <p class="slide-label reveal">Challenge</p>
    <h2 class="slide-h2 reveal">The LLM Scaling Dilemma:<br><em>Performance vs. Cost &amp; Speed</em></h2>
    <div class="two-col reveal">
      <div class="problem-card bad">
        <h3>Dense Model Costs</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Parameters grow proportionally with capability</li>
          <li>All weights activated per forward pass</li>
          <li>Training costs scale prohibitively with size</li>
          <li>KV cache grows linearly with heads × sequence length</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-card good">
        <h3>MoE Promise</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Sparse activation: only a fraction of experts fire per token</li>
          <li>Scale total params without scaling compute proportionally</li>
          <li>Still bottlenecked by attention KV cache at long contexts</li>
          <li>GQA/MQA reduce cache but sacrifice model quality</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="solution-bar reveal">
      <span class="label">DeepSeek-V2</span>
      <p>Combines sparse MoE (DeepSeekMoE) with a novel KV-efficient attention (MLA) to achieve top-tier performance at a fraction of inference and training cost.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===========================
     SLIDE 3 — ARCHITECTURE
     =========================== -->
<section class="slide arch-slide grid-bg" id="slide-3">
  <div class="orb orb-teal" style="width:clamp(120px,20vw,280px);height:clamp(120px,20vw,280px);top:10%;right:5%;opacity:0.25;"></div>
