    <div class="arch-layout">
      <div class="arch-text reveal-left">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>MLA replaces Multi-Head Attention</strong> — low-rank KV compression reduces cache by 93.3% while outperforming standard MHA</li>
          <li><strong>DeepSeekMoE replaces dense FFN</strong> — shared experts (always active) + routed experts (sparse top-K activation)</li>
          <li><strong>Device-limited routing</strong> constrains each token to experts on at most M devices, minimizing cross-node communication</li>
          <li><strong>236B total / 21B activated</strong> — only 8.9% of parameters fire per token</li>
          <li><strong>128K context window</strong> supported via decoupled RoPE positional embeddings in MLA</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="fig-container reveal-right">
