      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===========================
     SLIDE 4 — MLA MECHANISM
     =========================== -->
<section class="slide mla-slide grid-bg" id="slide-4">
  <div class="orb orb-blue" style="width:clamp(100px,18vw,250px);height:clamp(100px,18vw,250px);bottom:5%;left:5%;opacity:0.25;"></div>
  <div class="accent-bar"></div>
  <div class="slide-num">04 / 09</div>
  <div class="slide-content">
    <p class="slide-label reveal">Innovation 1</p>
    <h2 class="slide-h2 reveal">Multi-Head Latent Attention:<br><em>93.3% KV Cache Compression</em></h2>
    <div class="mla-layout">
      <div class="fig-container reveal-left">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,{fig2}" alt="Comparison of MHA, GQA, MQA, and MLA attention mechanisms">
      </div>
      <div class="mla-points reveal-right">
        <div class="mla-point">
          <h4>Standard MHA Bottleneck</h4>
          <p>Caches full K and V vectors per head per token — memory scales with n_heads × seq_len × d_head</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mla-point">
          <h4>GQA / MQA Trade-off</h4>
          <p>Share keys/values across heads to reduce cache, but sacrifice representational capacity and model quality</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mla-point highlight">
          <h4>MLA: Low-Rank KV Joint Compression</h4>
          <p>Compress K and V into a single compact latent vector <strong>c_t^KV</strong>. Cache only the latent; reconstruct K, V, and decoupled RoPE keys on-the-fly via learned projections</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mla-point highlight">
          <h4>Result: Strictly Better Than MHA</h4>
          <p>93.3% KV cache reduction <em>with superior performance</em> — not a trade-off but a Pareto improvement over GQA/MQA</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===========================
     SLIDE 5 — DEEPSEEKMOE
     =========================== -->
<section class="slide moe-slide grid-bg" id="slide-5">
  <div class="orb orb-amber" style="width:clamp(100px,18vw,250px);height:clamp(100px,18vw,250px);top:5%;right:10%;opacity:0.2;"></div>
